      <div class="tour-body"><div class="tour-duration">Extendable</div><h3>Kashgar to Almaty Extension</h3><p>Already visiting Kashgar? Extend your Silk Road journey westward. Our tours from Kashgar to Bishkek can continue to Almaty — the modern gateway to the Kazakh steppe. Cross the Tian Shan mountains and follow the footsteps of ancient Silk Road caravans into Kazakhstan.</p><a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-outline">View Extension Options</a></div>
